Package: projflow
Title: DAG-first scaffolding for reproducible analysis projects
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Thiago", "Oliveira", email = "thiago.paula.oliveira@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Thiago Oliveira [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Thiago Oliveira <thiago.paula.oliveira@gmail.com>
Description: Creates reproducible analysis project scaffolds organised into
    four layers: project structure, executable analysis DAG, governance, and
    interfaces/integrations. Includes external-data-aware defaults, project
    registries, diagnostics, dashboard helpers, and optional reproducibility
    infrastructure.
